#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:5 08178db9083945c28ba094d9e4f35fa4
msgid "Setting the input shaping parameters"
msgstr "设置输入整形参数"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:7 1c8dccb7df43491d9bd63ac0629ef53a
msgid ""
"Copter has a set of parameters that define the way the aircraft feels to "
"fly. This allows the aircraft to be set up with a very aggressive tune but "
"still feel like a very docile and friendly aircraft to fly."
msgstr "ArduCopter提供了一组定义飞机飞行手感的参数。这使得飞机可以在具有非常激进调参的同时，飞起来仍然感觉非常温顺易控。"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:9 51d2f02016e543afaefca085ebd69076
msgid "The most important of these parameters is:"
msgstr "这些参数中最重要的是："

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:11 40f031778bcd4c7d846221cbcbbdea7b
msgid ":ref:`PILOT_Y_RATE<PILOT_Y_RATE>`: desired maximum yaw rate in deg/s"
msgstr ":ref:`PILOT_Y_RATE<PILOT_Y_RATE>`：期望的最大偏航速率（单位：度/秒）"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:12 5fa42c9f69cd4ee2b89641277d6bf38b
#, fuzzy
msgid ":ref:`ATC_ACC_P_MAX<ATC_ACC_P_MAX>`: Pitch rate acceleration"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX>`：俯仰角速率加速度"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:13 87b9317a96244608bf52fad6891c7acb
#, fuzzy
msgid ":ref:`ATC_ACC_R_MAX<ATC_ACC_R_MAX>`: Roll rate acceleration"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX>`：横滚角速率加速度"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:14 28a903c8c4034add9e0e7c08066d678f
#, fuzzy
msgid ":ref:`ATC_ACC_Y_MAX<ATC_ACC_Y_MAX>`: Yaw rate acceleration"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX>`：偏航角速率加速度"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:15 5aab1027c8264698a1f3edf9f6f0c78f
#, fuzzy
msgid ":ref:`ATC_ANGLE_MAX<ATC_ANGLE_MAX>`:  maximum lean angle"
msgstr ":ref:`ANGLE_MAX <ANGLE_MAX>`：最大倾斜角"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:17 2523f1b60d314b56aafe9cd75e668cb8
msgid ":ref:`ATC_ANG_LIM_TC <ATC_ANG_LIM_TC>`: Aircraft smoothing time"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_ANG_LIM_TC <ATC_ANG_LIM_TC>`：飞机平滑时间常数"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:18 c86f086f896e434b924fc5c111b5af3c
#, fuzzy, no-python-format
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_INPUT_TC <ATC_INPUT_TC>`: Time to achieve 63% seady state pitch "
"and roll attitude. Multiply by 3 to determine time to achieve steady state "
"attitude."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_INPUT_TC <ATC_INPUT_TC>`：达到63%稳态俯仰和横滚姿态所需时间。乘以3可得到达到稳态姿态所需的时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:19 32dcd0b18dc641b18c354b50735fc155
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
":ref:`PILOT_Y_RATE_TC <PILOT_Y_RATE_TC>`: Time to achieve 63% steady state "
"yaw rate. Multiply by 3 to determine time to achieve steady state rate."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PILOT_Y_RATE_TC <PILOT_Y_RATE_TC>`：达到63%稳态偏航速率所需时间。乘以3可得到达到稳态速率所需的时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:22 fcdeb2450b5d4b869200b1826986ab7e
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Autotune will set the :ref:`ATC_ACC_P_MAX<ATC_ACC_P_MAX>`, "
":ref:`ATC_ACC_R_MAX<ATC_ACC_R_MAX>` and :ref:`ATC_ACC_Y_MAX<ATC_ACC_Y_MAX>` "
"parameters to their maximum based on measurements done during the Autotune "
"tests. These values should not be increased beyond what Autotune suggests "
"without careful testing. In most cases pilots will want to reduce these "
"values significantly."
msgstr ""
"AutoTune将根据AutoTune测试期间的测量结果，将 :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX "
"<ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX>`、:ref:`ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX>` 和 "
":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX>` "
"参数设置为其最大值。这些值在未经仔细测试的情况下不应超过AutoTune的建议值。大多数情况下，飞手会希望大幅降低这些值。"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:24 a43ef4d5eb0f440eb7a43e88f8ed0859
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For aircraft designed to carry large directly mounted payloads, the maximum "
"values of :ref:`ATC_ACC_P_MAX<ATC_ACC_P_MAX>`, "
":ref:`ATC_ACC_R_MAX<ATC_ACC_R_MAX>` and :ref:`ATC_ACC_Y_MAX<ATC_ACC_Y_MAX>` "
"should be reduced based on the minimum and maximum takeoff weight (TOW):"
msgstr ""
"对于设计用于携带大型直接安装载荷的飞机，:ref:`ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX "
"<ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX>`、:ref:`ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX>` 和 "
":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX>` 的最大值应根据最小和最大起飞重量（TOW）进行缩减："

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:26 cf5ad997594542309d0b73a09e69f502
#, fuzzy
msgid ":ref:`ATC_ACC_P_MAX<ATC_ACC_P_MAX>`  x (min_TOW / max_TOW)"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX>`  x (min_TOW / max_TOW)"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:27 c8d20c8e8db34842804ec46db44aa90a
#, fuzzy
msgid ":ref:`ATC_ACC_R_MAX<ATC_ACC_R_MAX>`  x (min_TOW / max_TOW)"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX>`  x (min_TOW / max_TOW)"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:28 91397d5376cb49f2b20ab52cfe9525e9
#, fuzzy
msgid ":ref:`ATC_ACC_Y_MAX<ATC_ACC_Y_MAX>`  x (min_TOW / max_TOW)"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX>`  x (min_TOW / max_TOW)"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:30 3a47ac48d6d54bc182bfccec60f3bc4a
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":ref:`PILOT_Y_RATE<PILOT_Y_RATE>` should be set to be approximately 0.5 x "
":ref:`ATC_ACC_Y_MAX<ATC_ACC_Y_MAX>` to ensure that the aircraft can achieve "
"full yaw rate in approximately half a second."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PILOT_Y_RATE<PILOT_Y_RATE>` 应设置为约0.005 x :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX "
"<ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX>`，以确保飞机能在约半秒内达到最大偏航速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:32 2bc8cb023c974d648f3e53a3c3a125f8
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_ANG_LIM_TC <ATC_ANG_LIM_TC>` may be increased to provide a very "
"smooth feeling on the sticks at the expense of a slower reaction time."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_ANG_LIM_TC <ATC_ANG_LIM_TC>` 可以增大，以牺牲较慢的响应时间为代价，提供非常平滑的摇杆手感。"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:34 e1edc2d4ab1b43fea0afcf55e2f74593
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Aerobatic aircraft should keep the :ref:`ATC_ACC_P_MAX<ATC_ACC_P_MAX>`, "
":ref:`ATC_ACC_R_MAX<ATC_ACC_R_MAX>` and :ref:`ATC_ACC_Y_MAX<ATC_ACC_Y_MAX>` "
"provided by autotune and reduce :ref:`ATC_ANG_LIM_TC <ATC_ANG_LIM_TC>` to "
"achieve the stick feel desired by the pilot. For pilots wanting to fly ACRO "
"the following input shaping parameters can be used to tune the feel of ACRO:"
msgstr ""
"特技飞机应保留AutoTune提供的 :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX "
"<ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX>`、:ref:`ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX>` 和 "
":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX>`，并降低 :ref:`ATC_ANG_LIM_TC "
"<ATC_ANG_LIM_TC>` 以达到飞手期望的摇杆手感。对于希望飞行Acro模式的飞手，可以使用以下输入整形参数来调整Acro的手感："

